// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`generateCostEstimate > snapshots the full-stack cost markdown 1`] = `
"# Cost estimate — full-stack

**Currency:** A$ (AUD)  
**Snapshot date:** 2026-05-19  
**Source:** https://prices.azure.com/api/retail/prices

## Caveats

- Indicative monthly figures. Real bills depend on traffic, region, reservations, and tier features Bunya does not model.
- Currency: A$ (AUD). AUD figures use 1.5000 AUD/USD. Override the rate in the Cost panel for accuracy.
- Snapshot date: 2026-05-19. Source: https://prices.azure.com/api/retail/prices.
- Egress, premium-feature add-ons, backup retention, and per-call billing are excluded.

## Line items

| Resource | Service | SKU | Monthly | Note |
| --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- |
| \`rg-full-stack\` | Resource Group | container | A$0.00 | No direct cost |
| \`vnet-full-stack\` | Virtual Network | container | A$0.00 | No direct cost for VNet itself |
| \`snet-app\` | Subnet | child | A$0.00 | No direct cost for the subnet |
| \`nsg-app\` | Network Security Group | ruleset | A$0.00 | No direct cost |
| \`pe-stg\` | Private Endpoint | per-endpoint | A$10.95 | Per-endpoint fixed cost + data processing |
| \`plan-full-stack\` | App Service Plan | B1 x 1 | A$82.13 | Basic B1, 1 instance, Linux |
| \`app-full-stack\` | App Service | (plan) | A$0.00 | Compute billed via App Service Plan |
| \`fn-full-stack\` | Function App | Consumption | A$0.00 | Consumption plan: first 1M executions/month free |
| \`swa-full-stack\` | Static Web App | Standard | A$13.50 | Static Web Apps Standard tier baseline |
| \`aks-full-stack\` | Azure Kubernetes Service | Standard_D2s_v5 x 3 | A$315.36 | AKS control plane is free; estimate is per D2s v5 node |
| \`vmss-full-stack\` | Virtual Machine Scale Set | Standard_B2s x 2 | A$94.17 | Linux VMSS, per B2s instance |
| \`fullstackstg\` | Storage Account | Standard_LRS | A$3.60 | 100GB hot blob + 10k ops, LRS |
| \`sqldb-full-stack\` | Azure SQL Database | S0 | A$22.50 | Standard S0 (10 DTU) |
| \`cos-full-stack\` | Cosmos DB | Provisioned 400 RU/s | A$36.00 | Provisioned 400 RU/s |
| \`kv-full-stack\` | Key Vault | standard | A$1.50 | Baseline operations (~10k/month) |
| \`ai-full-stack\` | Application Insights | workspace-based | A$0.00 | Workspace-based: billed via the Log Analytics workspace |
| \`log-full-stack\` | Log Analytics Workspace | PerGB2018 | A$17.25 | Pay-as-you-go, ~5GB ingested per month |
| \`fd-full-stack\` | Front Door | Standard_AzureFrontDoor | A$52.50 | Standard baseline + 10GB egress; traffic billed separately |
| \`agw-full-stack\` | Application Gateway | WAF_v2 | A$390.00 | WAF_v2, 2 capacity units, fixed price + capacity |
| \`apim-full-stack\` | API Management | Consumption | A$4.50 | Consumption beyond 1M free calls |
| \`acrfullstack\` | Container Registry | Basic | A$7.50 | Basic SKU |
| \`umi-full-stack\` | User-Assigned Identity | identity | A$0.00 | No direct cost |

**Total (indicative):** A$1051.45 per month
"
`;
